    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Run the model across the stated competency penalties and track structural-gene fitness, competency, and phenotypic fitness over time. Genetic assimilation is supported when structural fitness rises as competency declines while phenotype remains high.";
